<!-- 5. How the Process Works -->
<section class="sec" id="process">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <div style="text-align:center;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto">
      <p class="eyebrow">Clear, Honest Process</p>
      <h2>How We Work Together</h2>
      <p class="muted">Gathering decades of historical records can feel overwhelming. We handle the heavy lifting while keeping you informed every step of the way.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps" style="max-width:880px;margin:0 auto">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-n"></div>
        <div class="stack-sm">
          <h3>1. Discovery Consultation</h3>
          <p>A friendly 15-to-30 minute consultation with an experienced specialist. We learn where your family lived, their employment history, and documented medical conditions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-n"></div>
        <div class="stack-sm">
          <h3>2. Immediate Honest Evaluation</h3>
          <p>We review covered counties, diagnosis dates, and statutory requirements. If we do not believe a claim qualifies, we give you a fast, direct answer rather than dragging things out.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-n"></div>
        <div class="stack-sm">
          <h3>3. Thorough Records Hunt &amp; File Assembly</h3>
          <p>We locate and compile vital historical documents: county residency records, historical census and school records, employment rosters, pathology reports, and certified death certificates.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-n"></div>
        <div class="stack-sm">
          <h3>4. Claim Filing &amp; DOJ Tracking</h3>
          <p>We assemble and submit a complete, airtight claim package to the Department of Justice before the statutory deadline, monitoring progress until payment is issued.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

